Specifications
--------------

IEEE Std 1815-2012 is a licensed IEEE standard; it is not redistributed.
Function and object codes, sizes, bit positions, table orders and the
standard's short octet examples (used as test vectors) are facts, written
in our own words with clause references. No text of the standard is
reproduced. DNP3 is a protocol of the DNP Users Group; this project is
not affiliated with or endorsed by it or by the IEEE.

