Interop test peer (interop/, not part of the module's packages)
---------------------------------------------------------------

The nested test-only module interop/ builds opendnp3 3.1.2
(https://github.com/dnp3/opendnp3, Apache-2.0, Copyright 2010-2020 Green
Energy Corp and Automatak LLC, with its NOTICE) in a Docker container
from its sources and links two small programs of ours
(interop/peer/master.cpp and outstation.cpp, Apache-2.0) against it. No
opendnp3 source is included in this repository; the container image is
built on the tester's machine and not distributed.

Test data
---------

The tests use the octet examples of IEEE Std 1815-2012 named in each test
(clause 4 function code examples, the 9.2.4.3 frame, the Annex E CRC
table, the clause 8 segmenting example, the file transfer and data set
examples); RFC 3394 section 4, RFC 4231 test case 2 and RFC 2202 test
case 2 vectors; and the AES-GCM result for an all-zero key and IV (NIST
SP 800-38D test case 1). Every key, password, certificate, address and
point value in the tests and the examples is a made-up demo value; none
belongs to a real installation.
